    BRANCH
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "on completion of a transfer referred to in that subsection" -- "on completion of" read as "upon", and "upon" as "where" (assumed, not ruled: fork F-EVENT); ruled 2026-11-05 (b)
        IF NOT `the transfer referred to in subsection (1) is completed` THEN JUST FALSE
        IF `the right, power, duty or liability is the transferor's under or in connection with a contract of service so preserved` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "under or in connection with any such contract of service" (scope limit with no "only", ruled 2026-11-05 (c))
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

