        IF NOT `the transfer referred to in subsection (1) is completed` THEN JUST FALSE
        IF `the act or omission was done before the transfer by an employee employed in the undertaking or part transferred in relation to the transferor` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any act or omission done before the transfer by an employee employed in the undertaking or part transferred in relation to the transferor" (scope limit with no "only", ruled 2026-11-05 (c))
