-- src:1102 | (4) Subsections (1) and (2) do not transfer or otherwise affect the
-- src:1103 | liability of any person to be prosecuted for, convicted of and
-- src:1104 | sentenced for any offence.
@ref s 18A(4) (src:1102-1104)
GIVEN `the liability is a liability to be prosecuted for, convicted of or sentenced for an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 18A(4) subsections (1) and (2) transfer or otherwise affect the liability` MEANS
    IF `the liability is a liability to be prosecuted for, convicted of or sentenced for an offence`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Subsections (1) and (2) do not transfer or otherwise affect the liability of any person to be prosecuted for, convicted of and sentenced for any offence" -- marginal (a)
    THEN JUST FALSE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): subsection (4) speaks only of the liability to be prosecuted for, convicted of and sentenced for an offence
    ELSE NOTHING

DECLARE `s 18A(5) Actor` IS ONE OF
    `s 18A(5) the transferor`

DECLARE `s 18A(5) Action` IS ONE OF
    `s 18A(5) notify the affected employees and the trade union of affected employees of the matters in paragraphs (a), (b) and (c)`

-- src:1106 | (5) As soon as it is reasonable and before a transfer under
-- src:1107 | subsection (1) takes place, to enable consultations to take place
-- src:1108 | between the transferor and the affected employees and between the
-- src:1109 | transferor and a trade union of affected employees (if any), the
-- src:1110 | transferor must notify the affected employees and the trade union of
-- src:1111 | affected employees (if any) of —
-- src:1113 | (a) the fact that the transfer is to take place, the approximate
-- src:1114 | date on which it is to take place and the reasons for it;
-- src:1116 | (b) the implications of the transfer and the measures that the
-- src:1117 | transferor envisages taking, in connection with the transfer,
-- src:1118 | in relation to the affected employees or, if the transferor
-- src:1119 | envisages that no measures will be so taken, that fact; and
-- src:1121 | (c) the measures that the transferee envisages the transferee
-- src:1122 | will, in connection with the transfer, take in relation to such
-- src:1127 | of those employees as, by virtue of subsection (1), become
-- src:1128 | employees of the transferee after the transfer or, if the
-- src:1129 | transferee envisages that no measures will be so taken, that
-- src:1130 | fact.
@ref s 18A(5) (src:1106-1130)
GIVEN `a transfer under subsection (1) is to take place` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 18A(5) the transferor must notify the affected employees and the trade union of affected employees (if any) of the matters` MEANS
    IF `a transfer under subsection (1) is to take place`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "before a transfer under subsection (1) takes place"
    ELSE NOTHING

-- "before a transfer takes place" is a date: the notice is in time if it is given on
-- a day before the day of the transfer.  "As soon as it is reasonable" is the
-- judgment of the case, taken as a plain input (NOTES.md, fork F-18A(5)).
@ref s 18A(5) (src:1106-1111)
GIVEN `the day the transferor notified` IS A DATE
      `the day the transfer takes place` IS A DATE
      `the notice was given as soon as it was reasonable` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 18A(5) the transferor notified as soon as it was reasonable and before the transfer took place` MEANS
    IF (`the day the transferor notified` LESS THAN `the day the transfer takes place`) AND `the notice was given as soon as it was reasonable`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "As soon as it is reasonable and before a transfer under subsection (1) takes place" -- the notice came on or after the day of the transfer, or not as soon as it was reasonable (a period the text fixes in its own words: ruled 2026-11-05 (a))
    ELSE JUST FALSE

@ref s 18A(5) (src:1113-1130)
GIVEN `the notification states the fact that the transfer is to take place, the approximate date on which it is to take place and the reasons for it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notification states the implications of the transfer and the measures that the transferor envisages taking, or that no measures will be taken` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notification states the measures that the transferee envisages taking, or that no measures will be taken` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 18A(5)(a), (b) and (c) the notification is of all the matters` MEANS
    IF `the notification states the fact that the transfer is to take place, the approximate date on which it is to take place and the reasons for it` AND `the notification states the implications of the transfer and the measures that the transferor envisages taking, or that no measures will be taken` AND `the notification states the measures that the transferee envisages taking, or that no measures will be taken`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (silent): subsection (5) says of what the transferor "must notify" and does not say what follows if one of the matters is left out (marginal (b))
    ELSE NOTHING

-- The duty of subsection (5) as a regulative rule: the transferor must notify before the
-- day of the transfer (here a number of days from now; "as soon as it is reasonable" is
-- a judgment that no number carries, so only the outer limit is the deadline).
@ref s 18A(5) (src:1106-1111)
GIVEN `the number of days until the transfer takes place` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `s 18A(5) Actor` `s 18A(5) Action`
`s 18A(5) the transferor's duty to notify` MEANS
    PARTY `s 18A(5) the transferor`
    MUST `s 18A(5) notify the affected employees and the trade union of affected employees of the matters in paragraphs (a), (b) and (c)`
    WITHIN (`the number of days until the transfer takes place` MINUS 1)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `s 18A(5) the transferor` BECAUSE "the transferor did not notify the affected employees and the trade union before the transfer took place"

